       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. L17.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DEPT PIC X(8) VALUE "SALES".
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1250.50.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-EDITED PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           ADD WS-AMOUNT TO WS-TOTAL
           MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-EDITED
           DISPLAY "DEPARTMENT " WS-DEPT
           DISPLAY "TOTAL       " WS-EDITED
           STOP RUN.
